    "def": "Let \\(A_m=(1/4+m)/3\\), \\(B=1/12\\), \\(v_0(m)=(A_m,A_m,A_m,-B,-B,-B)^{\\prime}\\), and \\(v_1(m)=(-B,-B,-B,A_m,A_m,A_m)^{\\prime}\\). Define \\(\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{wit}}(m)=4\\{(A_m+B)I_6-v_0(m)v_0(m)^{\\prime}-v_1(m)v_1(m)^{\\prime}\\}\\).",
